# Taste — environment (copy to .env; never commit a real key)
# Meta Model API key for Muse Spark vision + SAM 3.1 scores ($150 credits).
# Leave empty and the vision pass stays pending — the UI says so explicitly
# and ranking uses neutral vision values instead of fake model output.
META_MODEL_API_KEY=
# Endpoint for the Meta Model API vision call. Defaults (2026-10-27, D2 prep)
# to https://api.meta.ai/v1/chat/completions with model muse-spark-1.3,
# so normally leave this blank — only set it to override the default.
# SAM 3.1 subject sharpness is not wired yet; its contract is unconfirmed.
META_MODEL_API_URL=
META_MODEL_API_MODEL=muse-spark-1.3
